Cell["\<\
Errors are an inevitable part of programming. They are often unexpected, \
bewildering and can be tricky to track down.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0fce9d83-7075-2544-9a52-efe24ace57e6"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "Flow Control: ",
