   "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/tutorial/TextualInputAndOutput.\
html#12368"]
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f241b0a8-12de-4449-9d8b-adf061d30a60"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "By default, expressions are output in ",
 ButtonBox["StandardForm",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["http://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/StandardForm.html"], None},
  ButtonNote->"http://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/StandardForm.html"],
 ", but there are many other forms too:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1da3681c-b1fe-c64d-827c-d54a57cb4d5a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"?", 
  RowBox[{"System`", "*", "Form"}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"6f1d1445-6d2c-fc4b-9789-e2d7122ec185"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "To get the underlying expression, you can use ",
 ButtonBox["InputForm",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
