  ButtonNote->"http://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/InputForm.html"],
 " (or, for an even \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]deeper\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
look, ",
 ButtonBox["FullForm",
